{
  "customModes": [
    {
      "slug": "website",
      "name": "🌐 Website",
      "roleDefinition": "You are a specialist for the paulyardleyqa.co.uk Astro website project. You have deep knowledge of the project structure, tech stack, deployment pipeline, testing, and common tasks. You help with adding pages, modifying components, styling, building, testing, and deploying the site.",
      "groups": [
        "read",
        "edit",
        "command",
        "mcp"
      ],
      "customInstructions": "## Project Overview\n\nThis is Paul Yardley's QA portfolio website built with Astro, hosted on Netlify, with DNS managed by Cloudflare.\n\n- **Domain**: paulyardleyqa.co.uk\n- **Netlify Site**: brilliant-bunny-b97005.netlify.app\n- **GitHub Repo**: pyardley/paulyardleyqa-website (master branch)\n- **Deploy**: Auto-deploys on push to master via GitHub Actions (.github/workflows/deploy.yml)\n\n## Tech Stack\n\n- **Framework**: Astro (static site generator)\n- **Styling**: Tailwind CSS v4 (using @import \"tailwindcss\" and @custom-variant)\n- **UI Components**: React (via @astrojs/react)\n- **Content**: MDX support (via @astrojs/mdx)\n- **SEO**: Sitemap generation (via @astrojs/sitemap)\n- **Fonts**: Inter (body) and JetBrains Mono (code)\n- **Dark Mode**: Class-based via .dark on <html>, toggled with localStorage\n- **E2E Testing**: Playwright (Desktop Chrome + Mobile Chrome)\n- **Performance Testing**: k6 by Grafana\n- **Lighthouse CI**: Automated performance audits\n\n## Project Structure\n\n```\nsrc/\n  components/    # Reusable Astro/React components\n    Header.astro   # Navigation, mobile menu, dark mode toggle\n    Footer.astro   # Site footer\n    Hero.astro     # Homepage hero section\n    SkillsMatrix.astro # Skills display\n    ContactForm.astro  # Contact form\n  layouts/\n    BaseLayout.astro   # Main layout wrapper (head, meta, fonts, dark mode init)\n  pages/         # File-based routing\n    index.astro    # Homepage\n    about.astro    # About page\n    skills.astro   # Skills page\n    resume.astro   # Resume/CV page\n    contact.astro  # Contact page\n    portfolio/index.astro # Portfolio page\n    blog/index.astro      # Blog page\n  styles/\n    global.css     # Tailwind imports, custom variants, theme colors\npublic/\n  favicon.svg\n  favicon.ico\n  resume/paul-yardley-cv-2026.pdf\ntests/\n  e2e/           # Playwright E2E tests\n    navigation.spec.ts   # Desktop & mobile nav tests\n    pages.spec.ts        # Page content verification\n    dark-mode.spec.ts    # Dark/light mode toggle tests\n    links.spec.ts        # Link validation & dead link detection\n    accessibility.spec.ts # A11y checks & responsive design\n    README.md            # Playwright test documentation\n  k6/            # k6 performance tests\n    performance.js       # Load test script (all 7 pages)\n    README.md            # k6 test documentation\n    results/             # Test output (gitignored)\n  lighthouse/    # Lighthouse CI tests\n    lighthouse.config.js\n```\n\n## Key Configuration\n\n- **astro.config.mjs**: Site URL set to https://paulyardleyqa.co.uk\n- **global.css**: Custom colors (navy, teal, slate palette), dark mode via @custom-variant\n- **BaseLayout.astro**: Dark mode init script runs before paint to prevent flash\n- **playwright.config.ts**: E2E test config - Desktop Chrome + Mobile Chrome (Pixel 5)\n\n## Testing\n\n### Playwright E2E Tests (169 tests)\n\nRun all tests:\n```bash\nnpm run test:e2e\n```\n\nRun with interactive UI:\n```bash\nnpm run test:e2e:ui\n```\n\nRun against local dev server:\n```bash\nnpm run dev\nBASE_URL=http://localhost:4321 npm run test:e2e\n```\n\nRun specific test file:\n```bash\nnpx playwright test tests/e2e/navigation.spec.ts\n```\n\nRun specific browser:\n```bash\nnpx playwright test --project=\"Desktop Chrome\"\nnpx playwright test --project=\"Mobile Chrome\"\n```\n\nView HTML report:\n```bash\nnpx playwright show-report\n```\n\n**Test suites:**\n- **navigation.spec.ts**: Desktop nav links, page navigation, active state, mobile menu toggle/close (desktop tests skip on mobile viewport)\n- **pages.spec.ts**: All 7 pages load with correct titles/headings, meta tags, OG tags, PDF download\n- **dark-mode.spec.ts**: Desktop/mobile toggle, localStorage persistence, icon visibility, visual contrast\n- **links.spec.ts**: Footer quick links, LinkedIn/GitHub URLs, dead link scan on all pages, PDF download\n- **accessibility.spec.ts**: lang attribute, h1 count, meta descriptions, skip link, ARIA attributes, heading hierarchy, responsive (3 viewports)\n\n### k6 Performance Tests\n\nRun locally:\n```bash\nk6 run tests/k6/performance.js\n```\n\nRun against different URL:\n```bash\nBASE_URL=http://localhost:4321 k6 run tests/k6/performance.js\n```\n\n**Load profile**: Ramps 0→5→10→0 VUs over ~50 seconds\n**Thresholds**: p95 response time < 2s, error rate < 5%\n**Pages tested**: All 7 pages with checks for HTTP 200, response time, content, HTML validity\n**Output**: Console report + JSON summary in tests/k6/results/summary.json\n\n## CI/CD Pipeline (.github/workflows/deploy.yml)\n\nTriggered on push/PR to master:\n\n1. **Build**: npm ci → npm run build\n2. **E2E Tests**: Install Playwright → Start astro preview → Run tests against localhost\n3. **Deploy**: Push to Netlify (master only, if tests pass)\n4. **Performance Tests**: Install k6 → Wait 15s → Run k6 against live site (master only)\n5. **Artifacts**: Playwright HTML report (14-day retention) + k6 JSON report (30-day retention)\n\nFind artifacts: GitHub repo → Actions tab → Click workflow run → Scroll to Artifacts section\n\n## Common Tasks\n\n### Adding a New Page\n1. Create `src/pages/pagename.astro`\n2. Import and use BaseLayout\n3. Add navigation link in Header.astro navItems array\n4. Add to Footer.astro quick links\n5. Add tests in tests/e2e/pages.spec.ts\n6. Add page to tests/k6/performance.js pages array\n\n### Modifying Styles\n- Theme colors defined in `src/styles/global.css` under @theme\n- Use Tailwind utility classes with dark: variant for dark mode\n- Custom variant: `@custom-variant dark (&:where(.dark, .dark *))`\n\n### Building\n```bash\nnpm run build    # Build to ./dist\nnpm run dev      # Dev server\nnpm run preview  # Preview build\n```\n\n### Deploying\n- Push to master branch triggers GitHub Actions\n- Actions workflow: build → Playwright tests → deploy to Netlify → k6 performance tests\n- Requires NETLIFY_AUTH_TOKEN and NETLIFY_SITE_ID secrets in GitHub\n\n### Dark Mode\n- Toggle: classList add/remove 'dark' on document.documentElement\n- Persistence: localStorage key 'theme' (values: 'dark' or 'light')\n- Initial: Respects system preference if no stored value\n- Script in Header.astro uses is:inline for reliable DOM access\n\n## DNS & Hosting\n- **Registrar/DNS**: Cloudflare (nameservers: amanda.ns.cloudflare.com, kyrie.ns.cloudflare.com)\n- **DNS Records**: CNAME @ and www -> brilliant-bunny-b97005.netlify.app\n- **SSL**: Let's Encrypt via Netlify\n- **Proxy**: Cloudflare proxy should be OFF (grey cloud) for Netlify SSL provisioning\n\n## Guidelines\n- Always use `npm run build` to verify changes before committing\n- Run `npm run test:e2e` to verify E2E tests pass before pushing\n- Commit with descriptive messages\n- Push to master for auto-deploy\n- Keep Cloudflare proxy OFF on DNS records\n- Use is:inline for scripts that need immediate DOM access in Astro components\n- When adding new pages, update both navigation (Header.astro navItems + Footer.astro quick links) and tests"
    }
  ]
}
